        "entry_type": "decision",
        "text": "**Central Worker Task Native Isolation**: On native environments, FreeRTOS task creation was executing synchronously during `begin()`, causing tests to loop infinitely on the queue. Guarded `xTaskCreate` with `#if defined(ESP_PLATFORM)` so background central worker runs on hardware while native tests interact deterministically via queue messages."
      }
    },
